# GENERATED, by `make manifest`. Not committed: it describes a PINNED release of
# contoso-data-product, and a committed copy is a second place that pin lives --
# stale the moment the pin moves, and stale in the way that still renders.
dbt/gold/target/
logs/
data/
product_snapshot.json

# `make show-product` stages the core's dbt projects here so they can be read
# without cloning contoso-data-product. Never edited, never committed: an
# edit here is a fork of the product that would be silently ignored.
product/
